sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Transfer service
  participant DB as Transactional engine
  C->>S: transfer(opId, A, B, 700)
  S->>DB: BEGIN
  S->>DB: look up opId
  alt opId exists with the same content
    DB-->>S: previous decision
    S-->>C: DUPLICATE, no second effect
  else new opId
    S->>DB: UPDATE A, debit WHERE balance >= 700
    alt 0 rows
      S->>DB: INSERT REJECTED operation and COMMIT
      S-->>C: REJECTED
    else 1 row
      S->>DB: UPDATE B, credit
      S->>DB: INSERT operation, two postings and outbox
      S->>DB: COMMIT
      S-->>C: COMMITTED
    end
  end
  Note over S,DB: crash before COMMIT: nothing committed<br/>response lost after COMMIT: the resend returns the decision
